# Applies to image builds that use the repo root as the build context.
# Currently that is only the web dev image (infra/docker-compose.yml). The API
# and CLI images build from their own app-scoped contexts and are unaffected.

# Installed deps and build output — the image reinstalls and rebuilds these.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS / editor / CI metadata
.git
.github
.vscode

# App trees the web image never copies.
apps/api
apps/cli
infra
docs
planning

# Local env files. The web dev server gets VITE_APP_API_URL from compose, so a
# stray local .env must not leak into the image and override it.
**/.env
**/.env.*

*.log
